<codeline lineno="8"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>typecasting_module_intro<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="9"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>`typecasting`<sp/>module<sp/>provides<sp/>a<sp/>set<sp/>of<sp/>classes<sp/>and<sp/>functions<sp/>for<sp/>handling<sp/>and<sp/>converting<sp/>different<sp/>data<sp/>types,<sp/>particularly<sp/>between<sp/>ROOT<sp/>and<sp/>PyTorch<sp/>tensors.</highlight></codeline>
