<codeline lineno="12"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>`variable_t`<sp/>class<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>versatile<sp/>data<sp/>container<sp/>that<sp/>can<sp/>hold<sp/>various<sp/>data<sp/>types,<sp/>including<sp/>scalars<sp/>and<sp/>vectors<sp/>of<sp/>different<sp/>dimensions.<sp/>It<sp/>is<sp/>used<sp/>to<sp/>interface<sp/>between<sp/>the<sp/>data<sp/>from<sp/>ROOT<sp/>files<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>PyTorch<sp/>tensors<sp/>used<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>machine<sp/>learning<sp/>models.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="13"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
