<codeline lineno="15"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`variable_t()`:<sp/>The<sp/>constructor.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="16"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`~variable_t()`:<sp/>The<sp/>destructor<sp/>cleans<sp/>up<sp/>the<sp/>allocated<sp/>memory.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="17"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="18"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@subsection<sp/>variable_t_methods_processing<sp/>Data<sp/>Processing</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="19"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`void<sp/>process(torch::Tensor*<sp/>data,<sp/>std::string*<sp/>varname,<sp/>TTree*<sp/>tr)`:<sp/>This<sp/>is<sp/>the<sp/>main<sp/>processing<sp/>method.<sp/>It<sp/>takes<sp/>a<sp/>PyTorch<sp/>tensor<sp/>and<sp/>a<sp/>variable<sp/>name,<sp/>determines<sp/>the<sp/>data<sp/>type<sp/>and<sp/>dimensions<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>tensor,<sp/>and<sp/>stores<sp/>the<sp/>data<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>appropriate<sp/>member<sp/>variable.<sp/>It<sp/>also<sp/>creates<sp/>a<sp/>branch<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>ROOT<sp/>tree<sp/>if<sp/>provided.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="20"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`void<sp/>process(std::vector&lt;...&gt;*<sp/>data,<sp/>std::string*<sp/>varname,<sp/>TTree*<sp/>tr)`:<sp/>A<sp/>set<sp/>of<sp/>overloaded<sp/>methods<sp/>for<sp/>processing<sp/>data<sp/>from<sp/>C++<sp/>vectors.</highlight></codeline>
